        "answer": {
          "short": "$y=2x-8$",
          "worked": "The $y$-intercept is $(0,-8)$, so $c=-8$.\n$$\\begin{align*}m&=\\frac{0-(-8)}{4-0}\\\\m&=2\\end{align*}$$\nUsing $y=mx+c$, the equation is $y=2x-8$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
